7) مثال تشغيل

examples/valid/capability.yaml

id: CAP-IDENTITY
kind: Capability
version: 1.0.0
namespace: vaixlns.identity
lifecycle: Stable
status: valid
relations:
  - type: implements
    target: SPEC-001

⸻

